PoxEcruteak_EcruteakCity_PokemonCenter_hns_2_Text:
	.string "The tower bell is rung by hand at\nthe ninth hour. Some nights the\pwind gets there first.\pThat is all it is. Wind and rope.$"

PoxEcruteak_EcruteakCity_PokemonCenter_hns_3::
